\par\par \uc2 Global development\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18I had an  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  on tour\u8217\'20\'19: celebrities share their stories in backlash to Roe v Wade leak\b0\par\par\uc2 Lizzy Davies \par \uc2 953 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2022\par 16:26 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par 25\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 TV stars, musicians and other high-profile women talk about their terminations, in wake of leaked \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  draft judgment\par \par \uc2 Television presenter Cathy Newman has become the latest high-profile woman to go public with her experience of having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as the possibility of the \uc2 US supreme court{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/may/02/roe-v-wade-abortion-supreme-court-draft-opinion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning Roe v Wade}}}\uc2  sparks a defiant outpouring of testimony.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IndyVoices/status/1522139630132420610?s=20&t=cOp7cDbNHPNs1f6vcOQnPw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Posting on Twitter}}}\uc2  on Thursday, the Channel 4 News presenter wrote that she was sad to have had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  but had \u8220\'20\'1Cnever for one second regretted it\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEvery woman \u8211\'20\'13 here, in America and the world over \u8211\'20\'13 needs to have that choice,\u8221\'20\'1D Newman said.\par \par \uc2 Since Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s draft opinion {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2022/05/02/supreme-court-abortion-draft-opinion-00029473"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was leaked to Politico}}}\uc2  on 2 May, setting out his belief that the landmark 1973 decision guaranteeing the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been \u8220\'20\'1Cegregiously wrong from the start\u8221\'20\'1D, women have been speaking out about their own terminations.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, the American singer-songwriter Phoebe Bridgers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/phoebe_bridgers/status/1521582506801254400?s=20&t=cOp7cDbNHPNs1f6vcOQnPw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CI had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in October of last year while I was on tour. I went to planned parenthood, where they gave me the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill. It was easy. Everyone deserves that kind of access.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In Manhattan, New York attorney general Letitia James told a crowd of protesters that for her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , she had \u8220\'20\'1Cwalked proudly into Planned Parenthood \u8211\'20\'13 and I make no apologies to anyone. To no one.\u8221\'20\'1D Describing herself as a woman of faith, James {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/es_indivisible/status/1521616407775035393?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1521616407775035393%7Ctwgr%5E%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fvinnews.com%2F2022%2F05%2F04%2Fwatch-ny-ag-letitia-james-was-proud-to-get-abortion-makes-no-aplogies-to-anyone%2F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the rally}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CMy God says that you\u8217\'20\'19ve got to make the best decision for you and your life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Writing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.independent.co.uk/voices/abortion-roe-v-wade-phoebe-bridgers-b2072057.html?r=55507"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in the Independent}}}\uc2 , Newman said Alito\u8217\'20\'19s leaked decision had brought back \u8220\'20\'1Cone of the most difficult times of [her] life\u8221\'20\'1D, after she and her husband were told, more than 15 years ago, that the baby she was carrying had a severe abnormality and would be unlikely to survive.\par \par \uc2 While many women have chosen to emphasise their relief at being able to end their pregnancies, Newman described the experience as \u8220\'20\'1Cdevastating\u8221\'20\'1D. But, she said, although the decision was difficult, it was right: \u8220\'20\'1CThere isn\u8217\'20\'19t a day I regret it,\u8221\'20\'1D she writes.\par \par \uc2 More women are now speaking up. The US podcast host {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MichaelaOkla"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michaela Okland}}}\uc2  told her 296,000 followers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MichaelaOkla/status/1521302080387833856?s=20&t=6k2bTzJ01RHvp1fnYDvjQA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on Twitter}}}\uc2  that she had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  aged 19, but had never felt comfortable talking about it online. \u8220\'20\'1CPeople have terrifying opinions on the topic, and even now I\u8217\'20\'19m scared to speak about it,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 Despite the stigma, women around the world have also gone public. Under the hashtags {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Myabortionstory?src=hashtag_click"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Myabortionstory}}}\uc2  and #ihadanabortion, \uc2 Twitter\uc2  users have recalled their experiences of ending a pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m hoping this catches on,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mobile.twitter.com/jarringcreation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote one.}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CI was in a very abusive marriage when I found out I was pregnant. I made the difficult choice to abort. I never would have left my abuser if I had had a child. I have no regrets. It should be a legal and safe option for any woman.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ejdickson"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ej Dickson}}}\uc2 , a \uc2 Rolling Stone\uc2  writer, posted: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19ve never shared this on here, but fuck it: I\u8217\'20\'19ve had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I also have one child, and I\u8217\'20\'19m currently expecting another. I\u8217\'20\'19ll be honest, I had incredibly complex feelings about both of these choices. But I never felt anything but deep gratitude that I *had* a choice.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/AmandaLSmythers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 student}}}\uc2  wrote that, five months into her PhD, she had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , knowing she couldn\u8217\'20\'19t have maintained her academic standards and given the child she already had the same opportunities.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPeople rightfully give sympathy to women who choose \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to medical reasons,\u8221\'20\'1D she wrote. \u8220\'20\'1CThat wasn\u8217\'20\'19t me. I was faced with the reality of my economic class & career aspirations. If love was currency, I could have given it in excess \u8230\'20\'26 but that\u8217\'20\'19s not the case.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The wave of testimonies is not the first provoked by shifts in the US legal landscape. Last year, when Texas passed its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/mar/03/texas-abortion-ban-six-months-grave-warning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 near-total ban}}}\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , actor Uma Thurman revealed how she terminated a pregnancy when she was a teenager. Although [it was] \u8220\'20\'1Cthe hardest decision of my life\u8221\'20\'1D, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/sep/22/uma-thurman-texas-abortion-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 she wrote}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1Cchoosing not to keep that early pregnancy allowed me to grow up and become the mother I wanted and needed to be.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In 2020, after the death of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/sep/18/ruth-bader-ginsburg-supreme-court-justice-dies-aged-87"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ruth Bader Ginsburg }}}\uc2  left a seat on the supreme court vacant for Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s nominee, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/oct/26/amy-coney-barretts-past-calls-into-question-her-pledges-of-impartiality"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Amy Coney Barrett}}}\uc2 , Fleetwood Mac vocalist Stevie Nicks said she had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 1979.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf I had not had that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , I\u8217\'20\'19m pretty sure there would have been no Fleetwood Mac,\u8221\'20\'1D she {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2020/oct/14/stevie-nicks-on-art-ageing-and-attraction-botox-makes-it-look-like-youre-in-a-satanic-cult"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Guardian}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s just no way that I could have had a child then, working as hard as we worked constantly. And there were a lot of drugs, I was doing a lot of drugs \u8230\'20\'26 I would have had to walk away.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In 2019, after the state of Georgia passed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2019/may/07/georgia-governor-signs-bill-to-ban-abortion-after-six-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 its \u8220\'20\'1Cheartbeat bill}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D, banning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks of pregnancy, British actor Jameela Jamil wrote on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  when I was young, and it was the best decision I have made. Both for me, and for the baby I didn\u8217\'20\'19t want, and wasn\u8217\'20\'19t ready for, emotionally, psychologically and financially. So many children will end up in foster homes. So many lives ruined. So very cruel.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The 2019 Georgia law was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/jul/13/us-judge-blocks-georgia-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 permanently blocked}}}\uc2  the following year by a federal judge, who found it violated the US constitution. In his ruling, Steve Jones cited precedents including Roe v Wade and a later supreme court decision, Casey v Planned Parenthood. Both those rulings, according to the document leaked this week, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2022/05/02/supreme-court-abortion-draft-opinion-00029473"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Cmust be overruled\u8221\'20\'1D.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220505ei550025t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
