\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Anti- \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  activist climbs San Francisco\u8217\'20\'19s tallest building\b0\par\par\uc2 Kari Paul \par \uc2 337 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 May 2022\par 14:52 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The activist, who has performed similar stunts in the past, was arrested at the top of the \uc2 Salesforce\uc2  tower Tuesday afternoon\par \par \uc2 A man was arrested in San Francisco on Tuesday after free-climbing the \uc2 Salesforce\uc2  tower, in a stunt apparently intended as a protest against \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The man, who calls himself the \u8220\'20\'1Cpro-life Spider-man\u8221\'20\'1D, was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcbayarea.com/news/local/person-reportedly-climbing-salesforce-tower-in-san-francisco-fire-department/2880627/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly arrested}}}\uc2  on Tuesday afternoon. The city\u8217\'20\'19s fire department confirmed the incident on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  and encouraged the public to \u8220\'20\'1Cjoin us in condemning this action\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Footage posted to social media from inside and outside the tower showed the man climbing the office skyscraper without safety gear. He was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abc7.com/man-climbing-salesforce-tower-sf-person-scaling-building-san-francisco-news/11814580/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly met}}}\uc2  by authorities at the top and swiftly taken into custody.\par \par \uc2 Someone is climbing the 60-floor Salesforce Tower in San Francisco right now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/xbVmi6tM31"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/xbVmi6tM31}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HrPFKshHKN"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HrPFKshHKN}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 philip lewis (@Phil_Lewis_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Phil_Lewis_/status/1521540396278587392?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 3, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Part two of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/salesforcetower?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #salesforcetower}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/freeclimber?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #freeclimber}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/E3fYrSbu2u"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/E3fYrSbu2u}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Lars Schwetje (@larsschwetje) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/larsschwetje/status/1521540541128658947?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 3, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 At 60 floors and 1,070 feet, the \uc2 Salesforce\uc2  tower is the second tallest building west of the Mississippi and the 17th tallest in the US, and is a defining feature of the San Francisco skyline.\par \par \uc2 The activist apparently sought to protest against a specific \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  provider, according to posts on his personal \uc2 Instagram\uc2 . He has gone to similarly extreme measures to draw attention to other rightwing causes in the past, including climbing the 600ft Aria hotel in August to protest Covid-19 mandates in the state.\par \par \uc2 The stunt came a day after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/may/03/biden-democrats-reaction-codifying-roe-v-wade-reform-scotus"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a leaked draft opinion}}}\uc2  revealed that the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  is poised to overturn Roe v Wade, the landmark decision guaranteeing the right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The unprecedented leak has sparked widespread protests across the US, with both pro-choice advocates and anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  advocates gathering outside the supreme court in Washington DC and in cities across the country, including Nashville, Dallas, New York City and New Orleans.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220504ei540005l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
