\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 According to one Republican, pregnancy from rape is \u8216\'20\'18an opportunity\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,188 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 April 2022\par 13:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ohio state representative Jean Schmidt said a baby created from rape could grow up to cure cancer \u8211\'20\'13 during a debate on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , naturally\par \par \uc2 Pregnancy from rape \u8216\'20\'18an opportunity\u8217\'20\'19 to cure cancer, says Republican\par \par \uc2 Like a deranged game of limbo, Republicans seem to be in competition to see just how low they can go. A couple of weeks ago a Republican in Tennessee was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rollingstone.com/politics/politics-news/frank-niceley-tennesee-state-senator-homeless-hitler-1337637/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lecturing homeless people}}}\uc2  on how they should look at Hitler (who spent some time living on the streets) as an inspiration. This week, a Republican in Ohio is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.merriam-webster.com/words-at-play/bothsidesing-bothsidesism-new-words-were-watching"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 both-sidesing}}}\uc2  rape. On the one hand, Ohio state representative Jean Schmidt mused during an Ohio house government oversight committee meeting on Wednesday, rape is bad. On the other hand, you\u8217\'20\'19ve also got to find the silver linings.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRape is a difficult issue,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://news.yahoo.com/pregnancy-rape-opportunity-women-says-185005884.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Schmidt said}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CBut if a baby is created, it is a human life and whether that mother ends that pregnancy or not the scars will not go away, period. It is a shame that it happens, but there\u8217\'20\'19s an opportunity for that woman \u8211\'20\'13 no matter how young or old she is \u8211\'20\'13 to make a determination about what she\u8217\'20\'19s going to do to help that life be a productive human being \u8230\'20\'26 That child can grow up and be something magnificent, a wonderful family person, cure cancer, etc.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As you will have gathered, Schmidt\u8217\'20\'19s remarks on rape were delivered during a debate on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Republicans in Ohio are trying to pass a \u8220\'20\'1Ctrigger ban\u8221\'20\'1D that would immediately criminalize \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the state, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.news5cleveland.com/news/politics/ohio-politics/ohio-considers-total-abortion-ban-without-exemption-for-rape-if-roe-v-wade-is-overturned"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 without any exemptions for rape or incest}}}\uc2 , if Roe v Wade is overturned by the supreme court. Because Republicans are extremely pro-life, as they love to remind us, the ban kindly makes an exemption for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in cases where it might save the life of the pregnant person. But you\u8217\'20\'19ve got to get two doctors who aren\u8217\'20\'19t professionally related to sign off on it first\u8211\'20\'13which, of course, will be very easy to do when you\u8217\'20\'19re in the middle of a medical emergency.\par \par \uc2 You know where there\u8217\'20\'19s absolutely no exemption? \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in cases where a child is raped. Schmidt\u8217\'20\'19s remarks were delivered in reply to a Democratic colleague had specifically asked her if her bill would force a 13-year-old girl who is raped to have the baby. It\u8217\'20\'19s this very specific scenario that Schmidt chose to present as an \u8220\'20\'1Copportunity\u8221\'20\'1D. This, let us remember, is a representative from a party which likes to present itself as a champion of \u8220\'20\'1Cfamily values\u8221\'20\'1D and postures nonstop about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2022/mar/30/republicans-gop-party-children-abuse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 protecting children from abuse}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The Republican party is also the party with the idea that the left is intent on indoctrinating and brainwashing schoolkids with wacky ideas like \u8220\'20\'1Cracism and sexism are bad\u8221\'20\'1D. Which is strange because, for a party that doesn\u8217\'20\'19t want kids to be brainwashed, it sure loves to do a bit of a brainwashing itself. Back in 2010 when Schmidt was a congresswoman, she {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wlwt.com/article/schmidt-under-fire-for-discussing-abortion-with-kids/3509853"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 took it upon herself}}}\uc2  to lecture a group of elementary school students \u8211\'20\'13 some of whom were as young as six \u8211\'20\'13 about how \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  involves killing a child before its born and is wrong. That\u8217\'20\'19s not brainwashing, folks, that\u8217\'20\'19s religion!\par \par \uc2 I\u8217\'20\'19m not sure it\u8217\'20\'19s really helpful to call the Republican party a \u8220\'20\'1Cparty\u8221\'20\'1D any more. That suggests that its ideas operate within a respectable and reasonable arena. Which, let\u8217\'20\'19s be very clear, they don\u8217\'20\'19t. The Republican party is becoming a full-blown extremist organisation: one that is intent on rolling back every single right that women and minorities have fought to achieve. And if you think calling Republicans \u8220\'20\'1Cextremist\u8221\'20\'1D is, well, extreme, please tell me how else you\u8217\'20\'19d like to describe a party that seem to think it is righteous and good to force a child to carry to term and give birth to a baby conceived by rape \u8211\'20\'13 and then, just to add insult to injury \u8211\'20\'13 want to ensure that there is no {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2022/apr/16/child-poverty-politicians-week-in-patriarchy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 governmental support}}}\uc2  when it comes to raising that baby? What makes things worse is that these people aren\u8217\'20\'19t just morally bankrupt hypocrites they\u8217\'20\'19re dangerously effective hypocrites. They\u8217\'20\'19re bad at moral consistency but they\u8217\'20\'19re very good at consolidating power.\par \par \uc2 Prehistoric women were hunters and artists as well as mothers\par \par \uc2 Could the prehistoric woman have it all? She certainly tried to, according to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/science/2022/apr/29/prehistoric-women-were-hunters-and-artists-not-just-mothers-book-reveals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new book about the women in prehistory}}}\uc2 . Rather than there being a strict gendered division of labour, the book argues that the stone age was actually rather advanced with \u8220\'20\'1Ccooperation between all members of the group, regardless of their gender or age.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump enthusiastically supports candidate accused of sexual assault\par \par \uc2 Birds of a feather {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2022/04/28/trumps-risky-primary-play-rallying-for-a-longtime-ally-accused-of-sexual-misconduct-00028611"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flock together}}}\uc2  !\par \par \uc2 Samsung ad featuring woman running alone at 2am criticized as \u8216\'20\'18naive\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 The advert comes after the death of 23-year-old Ashling Murphy, who was attacked while out running along a canal in Ireland, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2022/apr/28/samsung-ad-featuring-woman-running-alone-at-2am-criticised-as-naive"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier this year}}}\uc2 . She wasn\u8217\'20\'19t running at 2am (when very few women would feel safe running as anyone with a brain ought to realize) but in the afternoon.\par \par \uc2 US women of color increasingly seeking alternatives to hospital births\par \par \uc2 Births carried out at home or in community birthing centers increased by 20% from 2019 to 2020 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/apr/29/us-hospital-home-births-women-of-color#:~:text=US%20women%20of%20color%20increasingly%20seeking%20alternatives%20to%20hospital%20births%20%E2%80%93%20study,-Severe%20maternal%20morbidity&text=A%20growing%20number%20of%20non,a%20new%20report%20has%20revealed."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to a new study}}}\uc2  with non-white communities driving the rise. The increase for Black, non-Hispanic women was 30%, followed by 26% among Native Americans, 24% for Hispanic women and 18% for both Asian and white women.\par \par \uc2 Things that shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t need to be said: it\u8217\'20\'19s not OK to watch porn at work\par \par \uc2 Someone tell that to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2022/apr/27/chief-whip-investigates-reports-tory-mp-watched-porn-in-house-of-commons"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 British politicians}}}\uc2  please.\par \par \uc2 Girls shun physics A-level as they dislike \u8216\'20\'18hard maths\u8217\'20\'19, says UK social mobility head\par \par \uc2 Addressing a science {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/education/2022/apr/27/girls-shun-physics-a-level-as-they-dislike-hard-maths-says-social-mobility-head"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 and technology committee inquiry}}}\uc2  on diversity and inclusion Katharine Birbalsingh said \u8220\'20\'1Cphysics isn\u8217\'20\'19t something that girls tend to fancy. They don\u8217\'20\'19t want to do it, they don\u8217\'20\'19t like it.\u8221\'20\'1D She added: \u8220\'20\'1CThe research generally \u8230\'20\'26 just says that\u8217\'20\'19s a natural thing. I don\u8217\'20\'19t think there\u8217\'20\'19s anything external.\u8221\'20\'1D The mind boggles.\par \par \uc2 Indonesia fights violence against women with new law\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s taken almost a decade to do, but earlier this month Indonesian lawmakers passed a bill {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dw.com/en/indonesia-fights-violence-against-women-with-new-law/a-61637677"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 targeting sexual violence}}}\uc2 . The law expands the definition of rape to include rape between a married couple and acknowledges nine variations of sexual violence, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globalcitizen.org/en/content/indonesia-historic-sexual-violence-law/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 including online sexual violence}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The week in pawtriarchy\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/science-oddities-health-lifestyle-genetics-f6395d4d4aa78d6afc2b9e0bcaf3c7a8?utm_medium=AP_Oddities&utm_campaign=SocialFlow&utm_source=Twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new study}}}\uc2  has discovered what every pet owner may already suspect: your dog\u8217\'20\'19s personality may have little to do with its breed and popular stereotypes about dog breeds are not supported by science. Researchers couldn\u8217\'20\'19t find, for example, a genetic basis for aggressive behaviors nor a link to specific breeds. It turns out \u8220\'20\'1Cthere is a huge amount of behavioral variation in every breed, and at the end of the day, every dog really is an individual\u8221\'20\'1D. There\u8217\'20\'19s a lesson for humans there somewhere.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Arwa Mahdawi\u8217\'20\'19s new book, Strong Female Lead, is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/ARWAMAHDAWI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 available for order}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220430ei4u001e3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
