\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Sarah Weddington: tributes paid to lawyer who argued and won Roe v Wade\b0\par\par\uc2 Maya Yangin New York \par \uc2 547 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 December 2021\par 15:03 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Remarkable woman\u8217\'20\'19 Weddington hailed for role in 1973 case that established right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Tributes were paid to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/26/sarah-weddington-attorney-who-won-roe-v-wade-abortion-case-dies-aged-76"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sarah Weddington}}}\uc2  after the attorney who argued and won the landmark Roe v Wade case at the supreme court, establishing the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , died aged 76.\par \par \uc2 Susan Hays, a former student of Weddington\u8217\'20\'19s and a Democratic candidate for Texas agriculture commissioner, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hays4ag/status/1475221955565527045?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  that Weddington died on Sunday morning \u8220\'20\'1Cafter a series of health issues\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Alexis McGill Johnson\uc2 , president and chief executive of Planned Parenthood, the largest US provider of reproductive services including abortions, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/alexismcgill/status/1475275694938669057?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted:}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CWhat a loss. What a tremendous legacy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  will continue to honor Sarah Weddington\u8217\'20\'19s work every day \u8211\'20\'13 by keeping up the fight to ensure that everyone has access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Steve Vladeck, a professor at the University of Texas School of Law, from which Weddington graduated, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/steve_vladeck/status/1475225630849613825?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote:}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CSarah Weddington was 26 (!) when she first argued Roe before [the supreme court] in December 1971, just over three years after graduating.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA remarkable woman, a remarkable career, and a remarkable life. May her memory be a blessing.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Rabbi Danya Ruttenberg, of the National Council of Jewish Women, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheRaDR/status/1475326350139564038?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted:}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CMay her memory be a blessing that lights our way in our fight for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access and equity for all.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Juli\u225\'00\'E1n Castro, a Texas politician who was housing secretary under Barack Obama and ran for the Democratic presidential nomination in 2020, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JulianCastro/status/1475277138123239425?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote:}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CSarah Weddington was a proud Texan who led the charge to protect reproductive rights under Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShe leaves behind an incredible legacy \u8211\'20\'13 one we must defend now more than ever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He was referring to growing threats to Roe v Wade, including the Dobbs v Jackson Women\u8217\'20\'19s Health Organization {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/01/five-takeaways-us-supreme-court-mississippi-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 case}}}\uc2 , heard at the supreme court earlier this month, which could weaken provisions of the landmark ruling.\par \par \uc2 Colin Allred\uc2 , a civil rights attorney and Democratic congressman for Texas\u8217\'20\'19s 32nd district, touched on the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s decision to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/law/2021/dec/10/supreme-court-texas-abortion-ban-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 uphold}}}\uc2  a Texas \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law, the most extreme in the US to date, which bans abortions at six weeks and does not make exceptions for invest and rape.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTexas was home to Sarah Weddington who argued Roe, which no longer exists here,\u8221\'20\'1D Allred {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ColinAllredTX/status/1475261745178497026?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1COur history provides hope for our future. We must keep fighting for a better Texas.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Celia Israel, a Democratic member of the Texas state legislature, tweeted about studying under Weddington at the \uc2 University of Texas, Austin\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt was always hard to just call her \u8216\'20\'18Sarah\u8217\'20\'19,\u8221\'20\'1D Israel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CeliaIsrael/status/1475267743444344832?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CShe commanded respect \u8230\'20\'26 she taught a leadership class, held me to high standards and encouraged me to get involved and make my mark.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs is the case with teachers and leaders we look up to, we are their legacy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2017/mar/12/sarah-weddington-roe-v-wade-lawyer-legalise-abortion-america-donald-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with the Guardian in 2017, Weddington predicted: \u8220\'20\'1CWhatever else I do in my life, the headline on my obituary is always going to be \u8216\'20\'18Roe v Wade attorney dies\u8217\'20\'19.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She was at peace with that, she said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think most women of my generation can recall our feelings about the fight,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s like young love. You may not feel exactly the same, but you remember it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020211227ehcr001p6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
