\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 First Thing: California could become an  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  \u8216\'20\'18sanctuary\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Clea Skopeliti \par \uc2 1,018 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 December 2021\par 11:29 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 California could provide procedures and cover travel and accommodation costs for people from other states seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Plus, New Zealand bans smoking for the next generationDon\u8217\'20\'19t already get First Thing in your inbox? Sign up here\par \par \uc2 California is preparing to become a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/08/california-sanctuary-abortion-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Csanctuary\u8221\'20\'1D of reproductive care}}}\uc2  for people from other states seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the supreme court overturns Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 The California Future of \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Council, made up of more than 40 providers, advocacy groups and lawmakers, published a list of 45 recommendations, including covering travel and accommodation costs and procedures for people from other states.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 How many people travel to California for abortions? We don\u8217\'20\'19t know \u8211\'20\'13 but about 15% of all abortions nationally are performed in the state.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 How will the costs be covered? California will have an estimated $31bn surplus next year.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 How many states could ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ? More than two dozen states are ready to do so if the supreme court overturns Roe v Wade next year.\par \par \uc2 US government\uc2  to go carbon neutral by 2050\par \par \uc2 The federal government \u8211\'20\'13 the largest landowner, energy consumer and employer in the US \u8211\'20\'13 has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/08/biden-signs-order-government-net-zero-emissions-2050"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pledged to reach carbon neutrality}}}\uc2  by 2050 after \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  signed a new executive order.\par \par \uc2 The government will reduce its emissions by 65% by 2030, before reaching carbon neutrality by 2050, by transitioning to a completely electric fleet of vehicles and using electricity only from clean energy sources.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What are the deadlines\par \par \uc2 before 2050? All new government vehicles from 2035 will be zero-emission versions, while buildings must halve their emissions by 2032. All electricity must be clean by 2030.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What difference will this make? The order will tackle about 15% of all carbon emissions in the US.\par \par \uc2 Maxwell trial: third accuser\u8217\'20\'19s ex-boyfriend corroborates her account\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/08/ghislaine-maxwell-sex-trafficking-trial-third-accuser-ex-boyfriend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third accuser in Ghislaine Maxwell\u8217\'20\'19s sex-trafficking trial}}}\uc2  has had details of her testimony corroborated by an ex-boyfriend.\par \par \uc2 The accuser, Carolyn, said Maxwell began booking her in to give Jeffrey Epstein sexualized massages when she was 14, and also testified that Maxwell groped her. Carolyn said Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s abuse went on to include penetrative sex and group encounters.\par \par \uc2 She said she was introduced to Maxwell and Epstein after her boyfriend at the time, Shawn, introduced her to Virginia Giuffre in the early 2000s. Giuffre asked Carolyn if she wanted to earn money giving an older man a massage. Maxwell has pleaded not guilty to all charges.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What did Shawn testify? He said Carolyn \u8220\'20\'1Conly had two jobs ever\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 working for a fast-food restaurant and \u8220\'20\'1Cworking for Jeffrey\u8221\'20\'1D. Shawn said he would drive Carolyn and Giuffre to Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s house and they would leave with \u8220\'20\'1Chundred dollar bills\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 When did this happen? Carolyn said she went to Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s house {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/07/ghislaine-maxwell-sex-trafficking-trial-third-accuser"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than 100 times}}}\uc2  from age 14 to 18. She stopped seeing him at 18 when she was \u8220\'20\'1Ctoo old\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In other news \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 New Zealand will ban smoking for the next generation by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/09/new-zealand-to-ban-smoking-for-next-generation-in-bid-to-outlaw-habit-by-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raising the legal age to buy tobacco every year}}}\uc2 , so those aged 14 and under today are never legally able to buy it. The measure is one of a raft of policies aimed at making the country entirely smoke-free within the next four years.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The evidence against Jussie Smollett is \u8220\'20\'1Coverwhelming\u8221\'20\'1D, the prosecution has said in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/08/jussie-smollett-trial-closing-arguments-latest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 closing arguments in his criminal trial}}}\uc2 . The former Empire actor is facing charges, which he denies, that he lied to Chicago police about an 2019 attack.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The number of journalists in prison globally reached a new high in 2021, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/media/2021/dec/09/number-of-journalists-in-jail-around-the-world-at-new-high-says-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a study that found 293 reporters}}}\uc2  were behind bars on 1 December. At least 24 journalists were killed this year because of stories they had covered.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 A diver pulled a woman\u8217\'20\'19s body out of a car submerged in water near the edge of the Niagara Falls on Wednesday. It was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/08/niagara-falls-woman-car-coast-guard"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 too late to rescue the woman}}}\uc2 , who was said to have lived nearby.\par \par \uc2 Stat of the day: nearly 100 former British Council staff remain hidden in Afghanistan\par \par \uc2 Almost 100 former British Council staff contracted to teach British values and the English language {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/09/nearly-100-former-british-council-staff-remain-in-hiding-in-afghanistan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remain in hiding in Afghanistan}}}\uc2  after being refused the right to come to the UK. A former British Council Afghanistan English manager, Joseph Seaton, has said their applications have not been processed or responded to, months after they were sent. They are \u8220\'20\'1Cliving in constant fear of their lives\u8221\'20\'1D, Seaton said.\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss this: one woman\u8217\'20\'19s lifelong crusade against Hitler\u8217\'20\'19s favourite film-maker\par \par \uc2 The documentary maker Nina Gladitz made it her life\u8217\'20\'19s work to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/news/2021/dec/09/burying-leni-riefenstahl-nina-gladitz-lifelong-crusade-hitler-film-maker"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prove the complicity of Leni Riefenstahl}}}\uc2  in the horrors of nazism. As Hitler\u8217\'20\'19s favourite film-maker, Riefenstahl worked as a propagandist during the Nazi era, producing films considered landmarks of early cinema. After the war ended, she tried to distance herself from the regime, saying she had only wanted to make beautiful art: \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t know what I should apologise for. All my films won the top prize.\u8221\'20\'1D Berlin correspondent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/profile/kateconnolly"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kate Connolly}}}\uc2  charts Gladitz\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cobsessive\u8221\'20\'1D efforts to hold Riefenstahl to account.\par \par \uc2 \u8230\'20\'26 or this: an Indian woman\u8217\'20\'19s fight to reclaim her son after adoption without consent\par \par \uc2 After Anupama Chandran\u8217\'20\'19s parents put her baby up for adoption without her consent, she began a hunger strike, sitting by the gates of the Kerala state secretariat in all weathers. Chandran, the daughter of a local communist leader, and who is upper-caste, faced anger from her parents after falling in love and having a child with Ajith Kumar, a man from India\u8217\'20\'19s lowest caste. Hannah Ellis-Petersen, \uc2 the Guardian\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s south Asia correspondent, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/09/give-me-my-baby-an-indian-womans-fight-to-reclaim-her-son-after-adoption-without-consent"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports on}}}\uc2  how the couple defied the odds to get their baby back.\par \par \uc2 Last Thing: Botoxed camels barred from Saudi beauty contest\par \par \uc2 More than 40 camels were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/08/camels-enhanced-with-botox-barred-from-saudi-beauty-contest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disqualified from a beauty contest in Saudi Arabia}}}\uc2  after authorities ruled they had been given Botox injections and other cosmetic alternations. Artificial touch-ups are strictly prohibited at the King Abdulaziz camel festival, where camel breeders are invited to compete for about $66m in prize money.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020211209ehc9002v4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
